  {
   "id": "scale",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 670,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100104,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 100105,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Scale for grep. v1 generates 122 invocations when held to one flag at a time, out of 1,426,920 with no limit (our E0 study, v1 run in the Lima VM); the paper's default allows up to 4 flags,\nand each invocation is paired with several file-system states and input contents. The agent ran grep 72 times before writing and 155 times after, all on files it made by hand.",
   "originalText": "Scale for grep. v1 generates 122 invocations when held to one flag at a time, out of 1,426,920 with no limit (our E0 study, v1 run in the Lima VM); the paper's default allows up to 4 flags,\nand each invocation is paired with several file-system states and input contents. The agent ran grep 72 times before writing and 155 times after, all on files it made by hand.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "width": 1701,
   "height": 38
  },
  {
   "id": "footer",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 730,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100106,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 100107,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "v1 is shown as the paper designs it (sections 3-6), not as run for this comparison. This compares method, not output quality: neither output has been scored against the ground truth yet.",
